# Frontend environment. Copy to .env.local (gitignored).
#
# AGENT_PROXY_TARGET is read by the server-side proxy route only.
# Leave it unset for local development: the proxy defaults to the local
# agent server that `langctl dev` starts on port {{ backend_port }}.
#
# `langctl deploy` sets this on your hosting provider to the deployed
# Agent Server URL. You should not normally set it by hand.
# AGENT_PROXY_TARGET=

# Required only when AGENT_PROXY_TARGET points at a deployed Agent Server.
# Server-side only — never rename this to NEXT_PUBLIC_*, which would compile
# the key into the browser bundle.
# LANGSMITH_API_KEY=
